{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o024a","title":"诏诸王宗室携嫡子入朝","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o024a-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"诏诸王宗室携嫡子入朝","evidence":["mingdi-e-o024a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"下诏","evidence":["mingdi-e-o024a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":231,"label":"太和五年八月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y231","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o021","basis":"太和五年八月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o024a-q","mingdi-q-o021","mingdi-q-b-c8dc64098d12ed2b34ee"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o024a-q","source_order":[3,165,"O024a"],"order":795}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o024a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-f582e1c18ef76ea79688","layer":"original","quote":"八月，诏曰：“古者诸侯朝聘〖8〗，所以敦睦亲亲协和万国也〖9〗。先帝著令，‘不欲使诸王在京都’者，谓幼主在位，母后摄政；防微以渐，关诸盛衰也〖10〗。朕惟不见诸王十有二载，悠悠之怀，能不兴思！其令诸王及宗室公侯，各将嫡子一入朝〖11〗。后有少主、母后在宫者，自如先帝令。申明著于令。”","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":142,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-c8dc64098d12ed2b34ee","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c8dc64098d12ed2b34ee","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：太和五年（公元 231 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":167,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-99c1873dc57e954cfdf4","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o021","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b3a0b254d489f1ed2693","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月〖1〗，帝耕于籍田。三月，大司马曹真薨。诸葛亮寇天水。诏大将军司马宣王拒之。自去冬十月至此月，不雨。辛巳〖2〗，大雩〖3〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":16